# Asking whether in Russian: ли
subtitle: "Nina Petrovna asked Tom everything: learn to pass on a question in Russian, with ли after the word it's about."
tags: ["russian","indirect questions","ли","reported speech","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/indirect-questions"]
thumb: "band \"Asking whether in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Leading and driving in Russian: веду, везу","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/114-russian-lead-drive.cast"}

## Asking whether in Russian: ли
stress: new
level: basic
shuffle: true
heading: false

    icon c_tom size 190 set twemoji x 740 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    icon c_tphone size 90 set twemoji x 620 y 520 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone" hidden true
